      "content": "$$\\frac{1}{2}(1 + \\cos \\rho) = 2 \\int_{\\rho - \\pi/2}^{\\pi/2} u(\\theta) \\sin \\theta \\cos^{-1} (-\\cot \\rho \\cot \\theta) \\, d\\theta.$$",
