      "bottomRightY": 428,
      "content": "$$-\\frac{1}{2} \\cos x = -2u(x) \\sin x \\cos^{-1} (\\cot x \\tan x) + \\int_{\\pi/2}^{x} \\frac{u(\\theta) \\sin \\theta \\cot \\theta \\sec^2 x}{(1 - \\cot^2 \\theta \\tan^2 x)^{1/2}} \\, d\\theta$$",
