      "content": "$$\\cos^2 x = -4 \\int_{\\pi/2}^{x} \\frac{u(\\theta) \\cos \\theta}{(1 - \\cot^2 \\theta \\tan^2 x)^{1/2}} \\, d\\theta.$$",
      "confidenceScores": null,
