    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 90,
      "topLeftY": 500,
      "bottomRightX": 440,
      "bottomRightY": 519,
      "content": "If we set $z = \\cos^2 x$, $s = \\cos^2 \\theta$, and $w(s) = u(\\theta)$, we find",
